# The Gobbiebag Part IV (jeuno 30): reqsMet's operands one at a time, in both checks. Parts I-III completed (the chain's
# earlier parts, by a GM). The inventory at 30 (a fresh char): no section (43 (81)); at 45 (storage, a GM's
# player:changeContainerSize): Part III set accepted (a GM): no section; all met: 43 (46, 0, 1), begun. Accepted: Part
# III accepted: no section (Part III itself: its size 40 unmet); all met: 43 (46, 1, 1). A GM sets a part available
# before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # the inventory 30, not 45: no section; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 45                    # a GM's player:changeContainerSize to the part's start size
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii accepted # a GM: Part III not completed
trigger Bluffnix                        # no section (Part III: inventory 45 is not its 40); 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (46, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii accepted # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (46, 1, 1)
finish
